# Commit scopes

Titles must be `type(scope): subject` with **exactly one** scope from this list.

| Scope | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| `pad` | XY pad interaction, pad synth voice, pad visuals |
| `audio` | Web Audio engine, transport, drum/bass loops, presets |
| `ui` | Layout, HUD, selectors, typography, styles, shell markup |
| `chore` | Tooling, config, deps, Cursor rules, CI |
| `docs` | README and documentation only |

Do not invent scopes. Add a row here first if a new area is needed.
